WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A fictional administrative handoff rehearsal. Connect preparation, care, integration, referral and follow-up.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Track synthetic consent purpose and scope.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Care stages appear as records only.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Referrals are modeled; none are placed.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Follow-up ownership is an administrative signal.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
No clinical care, safety, or continuity outcome.
